# Audio assets live in this directory.
#
# The vertical slice does not ship binary audio; ``bullet_fire`` is
# generated procedurally by ``airwar/audio/sound_manager.py`` using
# pygame.sndarray. Once real BGM/SFX files (e.g. ``bgm_menu.ogg``,
# ``bullet_fire.wav``) are available, drop them here and wire
# ``SoundManager.play_bgm`` / ``play_sfx`` to load from this path.
